  "bg-canonical/0051649d84e5e3525b2119649803b3fb8cc57cd64d1d1b1f513ce814a6d5c261.webp": ["The dog is still keen. The dog is always keen. Respect.","Even the dog's breath is showing. That's the reading.","Frost already forming and the sun barely down: tonight means business.","A clear dusk on the Highveld is just the frost clearing its throat.","The dog can hear visitors from in here perfectly well.","Last check of the gate. With all your clothes on."],
  "bg-canonical/00989238a8dce054e9e41f24d5842ce5a5f90540d5cb7777662ff15df60e77f0.webp": ["Your breath is doing special effects.","Most beautiful time of day. Say the people who stay inside.","Your hands are in your pockets and they're not coming out.","You can see his breath, and the sheep are wearing the only good answer.","The Karoo does its coldest hour right before its prettiest one.","The sheep bunched before he opened the gate; they read the cold first.","Work didn't get the message about staying in.","Up before the sun. Still not impressed."],
  "bg-canonical/01082a853faf6df7bb29951b85ec914c4141c0761c5ae0cc36da0f583a50a273.webp": ["Even the seagulls are walking today.","Every one of them is pointing the same way and not one of them chose it.","Not one of them is flying, and that is the whole forecast right there.","The sand is going past them faster than the tide is coming in.","They will stand exactly like that until it drops, and it is not dropping."],
  "bg-canonical/012477e282cc086683649ec1ec90c89d3f0c857d6c8a02d84448f90f0f177ab1.webp": ["Unplug the things. The sky has plans.","The balcony beats the couch when the sky is doing this.","Sorry, what? An excellent evening not to have heard.","Supper inside. Somebody still has to clear a table."],
