  "bg-canonical/01edf502a02c55d47429a40d929162ca8ccae8ddf5864aeb1977e9a68e98eb58.webp": ["Cloudy dusk. Pretty, not promising.","The sky did extras. The forecast didn’t.","The sky left a two-finger gap for the sunset and the sunset took it.","All that cloud, and the sun still found the letterbox at the bottom.","The suburb is going to bed under a lid, with one orange nightlight left on."],
  "bg-canonical/03b8d3e5a890aab11369d8ffc337837091e80c8e332dc5e8b2169124db8ed486.webp": ["Sunrise chose drama today.","Every dog in the suburb filed a report at the same instant.","The dog has told the whole street about this.","You heard it. The dog is making absolutely sure."],
  "bg-canonical/05a3ab4a3961e26cac7cf68156003ffe149cd4d6144cbe16033ccb1fca7b659c.webp": ["Today's forecast: special effects.","The palms are pointing the way the storm is going, which is this way.","Your candles may finally justify that drawer.","Dinner for two. Torch for one."],
  "bg-canonical/08c461c74e9ce38b8691ebe8e3a0e8ddb26ab7bc2383fe23782784314b440539.webp": ["The house is colder inside than outside. Architecture is a beautiful thing.","One patch of sun came into this lounge and the dog got there first.","We can disagree under the same blanket.","Move closer. Nobody's asking you to forgive anyone."],
