  "bg-canonical/11312da815eb96a457a52b90da420cc20a665e644754d0d936e248e053661481.webp": ["The flag is doing its patriotic duty at about sixty kilometres an hour.","That shade sail is one good gust away from becoming a spinnaker.","The palm has given up on symmetry and committed to one direction.","Nobody on this side of Gqeberha is hanging washing out today.","The aloe is unbothered, which is the entire point of an aloe."],
