  "bg-canonical/13b538b6e4d9ace67c7b1a097dc91de6f14f3552b3fb8a90de6348bfbbcec4db.webp": ["Somewhere out there people are going for a run right now. Strength to them.","Ja, it's jersey weather. Double jersey.","The grass is wet, the air is cold, and the jersey was not optional.","Dew this heavy means the night got properly cold and stayed there.","Small dog, thick jersey, short patrol: winter mornings run on reduced hours.","Your alarm has no idea what it's asking.","The slippers are on. The rest is negotiable."],
