  "bg-canonical/8051f1c3947db45ae313770d285f8e1f01c73aeae2149e4ae7805770ab2ac7fd.webp": ["Jislaaik, stay inside!","Free IMAX this morning, boet.","You can skip the run with a clear conscience.","Your exercise excuse has finally arrived on time.","Shoes on. A remarkable waste of effort."],
  "bg-canonical/80639465edba98bf219e02b7c4d40e5953d718b51ed03a6ba2df6afd287ed1d0.webp": ["Somewhere a farmer is doing a small private dance nobody's allowed to see.","The dams get their drink before you get your coffee. Know your place.","Rain out here is an event; the whole veld will smell of it by seven.","An extra hour in bed would have cost the alarm nothing.","Time to get up. The roof has been up for hours."],
  "bg-canonical/817d8e1e843eea68438c39160fa0245e3e63d1a163b0e956e5c60ed810fd024a.webp": ["The commute just became a team sport.","Five more minutes in the car seems reasonable.","You can call this sitting in the car some me time.","Nearly inside. An excellent place to reconsider."],
  "bg-canonical/818a6e89a5f5ba80c9e5aca68d56a23f7fe924a5c711dac80f7879f30e9c1261.webp": ["Not the time for hero moves, hey.","Hail's down — cover the bakkie.","Your favourite parking spot has lost its appeal.","Car covered. You could do with the same treatment."],
  "bg-canonical/825a6ff641243640ad29eed63e07ddcee661e6e71a2c84850a6c999b7a1e062d.webp": ["The cold front is here and it brought friends.","Winter sun: all of the light, none of the heat. Nice try, sun.","Outside is a test of character. You're failing.","The garden tap grew a white beard overnight; the night was that serious.","That drop has been thinking about letting go since about four this morning.","The weeds can enjoy another day of freedom.","Gardening can stay a plan. A very good plan."],
  "bg-canonical/8278f1fd2e1e369312dd78e685f5227e7901146f5712f5d00e0fa16a294df725.webp": ["The braai is cancelled. Yes, really.","Your weekend now includes everybody else's branches.","Your quiet evening now includes a call to the roofer.","Home early. You may wish you hadn't been."],
  "bg-canonical/82ab32f7e25cc807f5730caebc989f682279caf5213d1f500e0cef0aa9f0a64e.webp": ["This is why Noah built a boat.","Somebody's weather report just got a lot longer.","So much for that expensive alarm clock.","Breakfast first. Checking the roof can wait."],
  "bg-canonical/83e944cbfa2a0236262766ded724d40a399c8bbc1a27f25d9a9b4cc8a577050a.webp": ["The heater is your best friend. Your only friend.","Your toes have filed a formal complaint.","Socks go on the heater first; feet join later — the winter system works.","Matching socks have slipped down the list.","Two pairs on. Suddenly the shoes are the problem."],
