  "bg-canonical/844ccaf4333e68341736fd9b55e945d7c6addee3ce85229251d45d15175e5cb7.webp": ["The sun has just come up, which is the part nobody is going to believe.","That bonnet did not cool down overnight, which is the part that should worry you.","That egg has been on there about four minutes and it is nearly done.","Nobody in this dorp has needed a stove since about the second week of December.","Monday, and breakfast in this dorp has been sorted by a car bonnet.","6am and the sun is already done warming up. That wasn't a warm-up, that was a warning.","The berg wind turned overnight. Cape Town, today you're basically Upington."],
