  "bg-canonical/86ce321be59c54933d8c42dbe080d373300c4ad850a84f57839dccbf00e5ca7e.webp": ["Lekker koud, but the rugby fields are about to look perfect.","Perfect rugby weather. For the spectators with blankets.","Blue sky, gold grass, white edges: a Highveld rugby morning in full kit.","How many warm-ups were you planning on doing?","Boots packed. Still negotiating with the legs."],
