  "bg-canonical/88617f054c9bf6cac35b3a1f9bca03c04f57d3955484d147cd7e4bd69c3b7e6c.webp": ["The sun is really milking this exit. Honestly, deserved.","Cirrus this pink means the sky is completely dry all the way up.","A sunset like this pulls an audience, and tonight it is two birds on a wire.","Monday got the best sky of the week and is wasting it on a farm road."],
