  "bg-canonical/88f884c93f2ae86820065486b03edb2c3a325d2df066b2337340111f97e0992f.webp": ["Visibility has clocked off. You're on your own.","Forward is still an option. Sightseeing is not.","How much of this walk did you actually promise?","Same route. More imagination required."],
