  "bg-canonical/8cc0e2a4cb5284d07dad4ddeabe7776a0c10ae44b6de24b0204b130691d28b33.webp": ["The mountain is in there somewhere, wrapped up for the winter.","The beach has gone to one colour, and it is the cold one.","Nobody's footprints on that sand today; the cold is keeping its beach to itself.","The scenic route can manage without you.","You've had fresh air. Nobody said how much."],
  "bg-canonical/8cc6367de3d1e1ccb2084168b423842ac75ae584dc7cc05600ff57f5867db19b.webp": ["Clear sky tonight. That means the cold has an all-access pass.","The frost has already started its shift. By dawn the lawn will be glass.","The bin run is being done at speed tonight, and the sky knows why.","Taking the bin out counts as your evening walk.","Taking the bin out should count towards your steps.","Shoes on this time. You've learnt."],
  "bg-canonical/90566b9c8c8cbcf5e7693de288906baa06f09141f418c43b3114a1d46d87904d.webp": ["Whoever booked the four o'clock meeting is going to be sitting in it alone.","Absolutely beautiful out there.","Forty floors of glass and every one of them is showing the same blue.","The afternoon held exactly like the morning promised, which almost never happens."],
