  "bg-canonical/928ed2d8b02f58eaac182c6a5e49f0a9ec1fe3cb8e4ccac86b5d6c3d110bf26b.webp": ["The moon's doing the most tonight.","Verandah weather. The couch will understand.","The moon is out and somebody small is hearing about it for the first time.","Not a cloud. Just you and the Southern Cross.","Clear enough that even the cat is checking the sky."],
  "bg-canonical/929560dd0f3239cd5abfe9959a7820a70a89246c9519112016776383c2773f32.webp": ["Tile floors are tonight's villain. Wear something on your feet.","Movie night starts early. Getting warm takes time.","The remote can wait until your hand is out again.","Movie night. Nobody's voting for a trip to the shops."],
