  "bg/cloudy/week_3/day/1.webp": ["The sky is the colour of an old Tupperware lid.","The sun's on airplane mode.","Forecast says maybe. We say probably.","Half the sky has an opinion and the other half is about to hear it.","The week's weather is changing hands right there, in one straight line.","Blue on the left, business on the right, and the line is moving your way."],
  "bg/cloudy/week_3/day/2.webp": ["Even the weather can't be bothered today.","The sky's giving 'I'll try again tomorrow' energy.","Perfect weather for existing without enthusiasm.","A grey day reads the same in any language: blanket, stoep, minimal ambition.","The concrete is still damp and the sky looks like it isn't finished.","Under a sky like this the whole garden runs at half-speed, dog included."],
  "bg/cloudy/week_3/day/3.webp": ["The sun's bunking today.","The clouds are here but they're not doing anything.","Flat grey over the rugby field: perfect kicking weather, no wind to blame.","The sky has gone the colour of the staff-room ceiling and settled in.","A perfectly average sky doing perfectly average things."],
  "bg/cloudy/week_3/day/4.webp": ["Take a brolly just in case, hey.","50/50 on getting wet. Like a coin toss.","Pack an umbrella. Or don't. We don't know either.","Umbrella in one hand, sunglasses in the other — he has met this sky before.","That sky refuses to commit, so he came prepared for both of its moods.","Bring a jacket. Or sunscreen. Or both."],
  "bg/cloudy/week_3/day/5.webp": ["Grey is also a colour, says my ma. Today I believe her.","The sun is technically present. Spiritually elsewhere.","This weather has 'meh' written all over it.","The one animal that can match the sky's mood is having no trouble today.","Every leaf is holding still; the whole garden is waiting to see what the sky decides.","The clouds are here but they're not doing anything."],
