  "bg/cold/week_4/day/1.webp": ["Wet road, grey sky, dog in a jersey: winter is fully operational.","Cold like this makes a walk feel like work.","Even the short way home feels ambitious.","Dry socks first. We can talk while you find them."],
  "bg/cold/week_4/day/2.webp": ["The yard is wet, the air is cold, and security has suspended patrols.","That is not a dog refusing a walk; that is a dog reading a forecast.","Even the boerboel checked the weather and sat back down.","The walk is still being discussed by both parties.","You said outside. The dog heard something else."],
  "bg/cold/week_4/day/3.webp": ["The heater is your best friend. Your only friend.","Your toes have filed a formal complaint.","Socks go on the heater first; feet join later — the winter system works.","Matching socks have slipped down the list.","Two pairs on. Suddenly the shoes are the problem."],
  "bg/cold/week_4/day/4.webp": ["Hot chocolate is not a want. It's a need.","Gloves-around-the-cup weather: the coffee is doing two jobs at once.","Your jacket has a jacket. It's that kind of day.","You've bought that coffee mostly for your hands.","Have a sip. Your fingers can take a turn."],
  "bg/cold/week_4/day/5.webp": ["Even the Capetonians are admitting it's cold.","The jersey got promoted to balaclava somewhere between the door and the gate.","The air found the one gap in the outfit and he is closing it by hand.","It's jersey weather. Under your jersey.","A nod will do; your hands are staying in your pockets.","Back for the scarf. You were nearly brave."],
  "bg/cold/week_4/day/6.webp": ["The washing is not going to dry. We hang it up for hope.","The sausage dog has a jersey. He didn't ask for it, but he wears it with dignity.","Cold plus beautiful is an honest trade. We'll take it.","Snow on the berg, washing on the line: cold enough to freeze, dry enough to try.","You need that jersey more than it needs washing.","The second layer stays. Yes, even in the sun."],
  "bg/cold/week_4/day/7.webp": ["The great debate: do we switch the heater on too, or are we not made of money?","Chair turned to the heater, blanket up, tea close: winter Sunday, executed correctly.","You're making tea? Suddenly everyone needs some.","The blanket comes too. It's only the kitchen."],
