  "bg/fog/week_3/dawn/1.webp": ["The hi-vis is doing exactly what it was bought for this morning.","Those headlights have been 'almost here' for two full minutes of fog.","The school run now involves finding the school.","Your lift has been nearly here for quite a while.","Bags ready. The bus is keeping its location vague.","The fog swallowed the whole street and gave up at the hi-vis.","Those headlights have been ‘almost here’ for five minutes. Fog time runs slower.","Everything past the streetlight is a rumour until about nine."],
  "bg/fog/week_3/dawn/2.webp": ["The cows know exactly where they are. Which is more than the rest of us can say.","Visibility is down to one cow.","Keep the plans vague; the neighbours won't notice.","One thing at a time. Convenient, really."],
  "bg/fog/week_3/dawn/3.webp": ["Silent Hill vibes. Without the monsters. Hopefully.","One lit window is taking on the whole fog, and losing beautifully.","The fog is thick enough to hold a beam of kitchen light like a solid object.","Don't feel obliged to join the day before coffee.","Coffee first. Then we can discuss going anywhere."],
