  "bg/rain/week_2/day/1.webp": ["Solidarity to everyone with one wet shoe right now.","Wet jeans for the rest of the day. The classic punishment.","Tea tastes better when your socks aren't involved.","Tea, then. Make it long enough to feel your toes."],
  "bg/rain/week_2/day/2.webp": ["The umbrella broke on the first gust. Classic.","Somewhere an umbrella just turned inside out. Moment of silence.","Hair plans: cancelled.","Your umbrella warranty has some explaining to do.","Your expensive umbrella has chosen a short career.","Hair done. That was money well spent."],
  "bg/rain/week_2/day/3.webp": ["Joburg rain keeps a diary: 2pm sharp, maximum drama, no apologies.","You might be working from home by popular demand.","Shop later. The last biscuit will have to stretch."],
  "bg/rain/week_2/day/4.webp": ["The puddle outside the gate is now part of the curriculum.","Did you pack a second pair of socks for yourself?","Bell first. Sock negotiations afterwards."],
  "bg/rain/week_2/day/5.webp": ["Forgot your jacket? The universe noticed.","The boss can hold the umbrella for once.","You wanted a shorter meeting. Now you're trapped.","This is closer than you meant by team building.","Meeting done. Lift negotiations have just begun."],
  "bg/rain/week_2/day/6.webp": ["Someone's braai just got ruined.","The person who mops would like a word with you.","Boots off first. This is apparently news again."],
  "bg/rain/week_2/day/7.webp": ["The garden's saying dankie at last.","At least the garden's happy. Someone has to be.","Watering can wait; you've done enough standing about.","Call later. The roof would like to finish speaking."],
