  "bg/storm/week_3/dawn/6.webp": ["Jislaaik, stay inside!","Free IMAX this morning, boet.","You can skip the run with a clear conscience.","Your exercise excuse has finally arrived on time.","Shoes on. A remarkable waste of effort."],
  "bg/storm/week_3/dawn/7.webp": ["Rusks first. Panic later.","Your first coffee deserves your undivided attention.","Up early. Not quite by choice."],
  "bg/storm/week_3/day/1.webp": ["Somewhere a weather reporter is living their best life.","The wind has a personal vendetta against umbrellas.","Your cheapest umbrella has explained its price.","Walk postponed. The apology can happen by phone."],
  "bg/storm/week_3/day/2.webp": ["The sky is in charge now.","Not weather you walk through.","Storm. Plans can wait.","Outside is closed until further notice.","You can wait. Your shopping has nowhere else to be.","You only popped out for milk and now have friends.","Shopping done. Apparently you're staying for tea."],
  "bg/storm/week_3/day/3.webp": ["Thunder rolling in. Inside is the move.","Two club selections left: the clubhouse or the car.","The eighteenth can wait; the sky is playing through.","Your scorecard can stop getting worse now.","Finally, a respectable excuse for your scorecard.","Clubs packed. Your pride gets to come home intact."],
  "bg/storm/week_3/day/4.webp": ["Respect the thunder. It's earned it.","Your batting average survives another day.","Try the coach now; your excuse has improved.","Practice cancelled. Try looking less pleased."],
  "bg/storm/week_3/day/5.webp": ["Lightning's putting on a show — watch from the window.","Nature just reminded us of the pecking order.","Thunder counts double when you have ears like that.","Your lap is now reserved for the entire dog.","You can be brave once the dog believes you.","Lap available. Terms now set by the dog."],
  "bg/storm/week_3/day/6.webp": ["When the sky starts talking, everything else stops.","Serious weather. The rest is postponed.","Kickoff is under review by the only official that outranks the referee.","Your team has found someone else to blame for once.","Match delayed. Everyone is suddenly a forecaster."],
  "bg/storm/week_3/day/7.webp": ["Free fireworks, no tickets needed.","At last, a break from being asked to stop the car.","Keys ready. No particular hurry to use them."],
  "bg/storm/week_3/dusk/1.webp": ["Unplug the things. The sky has plans.","The balcony beats the couch when the sky is doing this.","Sorry, what? An excellent evening not to have heard.","Supper inside. Somebody still has to clear a table."],
  "bg/storm/week_3/dusk/2.webp": ["Lightning's putting Eskom's grid to shame.","Your video won't settle the argument about the size.","Your family has already seen three videos like yours.","Phone away. You can watch the next one yourself."],
  "bg/storm/week_3/dusk/3.webp": ["Today's forecast: special effects.","The palms are pointing the way the storm is going, which is this way.","Your candles may finally justify that drawer.","Dinner for two. Torch for one."],
  "bg/storm/week_3/dusk/4.webp": ["Storm on the horizon. That's your deadline.","Finish up. The weather won't.","Storm's close. Home is closer, hopefully.","Just one last job before home, you said.","Home soon. You have stopped putting a time on it."],
  "bg/storm/week_3/dusk/5.webp": ["Somewhere up there the rain found a way in, and it is being managed.","Your landlord is about to hear from you again.","Quiet evening. You should have said it softly."],
  "bg/storm/week_3/dusk/6.webp": ["The braai is cancelled. Yes, really.","Your weekend now includes everybody else's branches.","Your quiet evening now includes a call to the roofer.","Home early. You may wish you hadn't been."],
  "bg/storm/week_3/dusk/7.webp": ["Eskom wishes it had this power.","Nature's doing its own load shedding.","Nobody believed you fancied an evening walk anyway.","Going out tonight. As far as the gate, perhaps."],
  "bg/storm/week_3/night/1.webp": ["The gutter is telling you exactly how long you left it.","The hose reel is going to feel very unnecessary for a while.","Jacaranda season and a Monday, and the paving is taking both badly.","Whoever parked in the street tonight is regretting it right now.","That security light is doing the best work it has done all year.","Your roof repair savings have been noticed.","Sleep first. Tomorrow has acquired a few expenses."],
