  "bg/storm/week_4/day/1.webp": ["Get inside weather.","Stay in. That's the whole forecast.","Even the hadedas are quiet.","Could we discuss the plan with fewer outdoor bits?","Everyone inside. The argument fits in here too."],
  "bg/storm/week_4/day/2.webp": ["The sky just went full Carte Blanche.","Every loose object in the garden has chosen violence.","Best greet the neighbour before asking for things back.","Chores postponed. Several new ones are on the way."],
  "bg/storm/week_4/day/3.webp": ["Storm with wind attached.","The storm has arrived. Everything else can wait.","Unsecured objects are now weather.","Your plastic chairs may visit before you do.","Visitors postponed. The furniture may still go.","That grey column is someone’s afternoon getting cancelled. Ours is next in line.","Highveld rain doesn’t arrive. It gets delivered — all at once, one farm at a time."],
  "bg/storm/week_4/day/4.webp": ["Cancel everything. Even your excuses.","Your evening braai has acquired an indoor committee.","Guests at six. Best revise what you promised them."],
  "bg/storm/week_4/day/5.webp": ["Not the time for hero moves, hey.","Hail's down — cover the bakkie.","Your favourite parking spot has lost its appeal.","Car covered. You could do with the same treatment."],
  "bg/storm/week_4/day/6.webp": ["The sky's having a full-on tantrum.","Mum would like her concerns put in writing.","Plans cancelled. You seem surprisingly relieved."],
  "bg/storm/week_4/day/7.webp": ["Nature's having a word. Best to listen.","You can explain your plans to someone who listens.","Jobs listed. Best put a pencil next to them."],
